        <mxCell id="tDsnQUMN67VsNcIccgpt-69" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rate Limiter&lt;/strong&gt; — hiện tại Nginx làm API gateway nhưng chưa thấy rate limiting rõ ràng&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Service Discovery&lt;/strong&gt; (Consul/etcd) — khi scale nhiều instance&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Distributed Tracing&lt;/strong&gt; (Jaeger/Zipkin) — debug call chain giữa các service&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Centralized Logging&lt;/strong&gt; (ELK Stack) — tập trung log&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Circuit Breaker&lt;/strong&gt; — tránh cascade failure giữa các gRPC call&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Config Service&lt;/strong&gt; — quản lý config tập trung&lt;/li&gt;" vertex="1">
